        </picture>
    </div>
    <div class="container">

        <div class="hive-triad__metrics">

            <article class="hive-triad__metric">
                <h2 class="hive-triad__metric-value">
                    3,500 mg
                </h2>

                <p class="hive-triad__metric-text">
                    Active hive compounds<br>
                    per stick
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="hive-triad__metric">
                <h2 class="hive-triad__metric-value">
                    ~100%
                </h2>

                <p class="hive-triad__metric-text">
                    Bioavailability of Bee Bread<br>
                    vs. 15–30% raw pollen
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="hive-triad__metric">
                <h2 class="hive-triad__metric-value">
                    7X
                </h2>

                <p class="hive-triad__metric-text">
                    The standard capsule dose<br>
                    in one stick
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="hive-triad__metric">
                <h2 class="hive-triad__metric-value">
                    0
                </h2>

                <p class="hive-triad__metric-text">
                    Fillers, sugar,<br>
                    or artificial additives
                </p>
            </article>

        </div>

        <div class="hive-triad__heading">
            <span class="hive-triad__label ts-badge">
                THE HIVE TRIAD
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="hive-triad__header">

            <h2 class="hive-triad__title">
                The beehive is a living biological system<br>
                Api-Complex preserves that logic
            </h2>

            <div class="hive-triad__description">
                <p>
                    Every compound serves the whole. Nothing is included as a
                    checkmark. Each ingredient appears at the concentration
                    required to do its job — and only its job.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="hive-triad__cards">

            <article class="hive-triad-card">

                <picture class="hive-triad-card__picture">
                    <source
                        media="(max-width: 651px)"
                        srcset="{{ 'the-hive-triad-item-1.avif' | file_url | as_avif | append: '&width=390' }}" type="image/avif">
                    <source srcset="{{ 'the-hive-triad-item-1.avif' | file_url | as_avif }}" type="image/avif">
                    <img src="{{ 'the-hive-triad-item-1.webp' | file_url }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="low" alt="Bee Bread" width="604" height="604">
                </picture>

                <div class="hive-triad-card__body">

                    <span class="hive-triad-card__label">
                        01 — BEE BREAD
                    </span>

                    <h3 class="hive-triad-card__dose">
                        2,500mg
                    </h3>

                    <p class="hive-triad-card__subtitle">
                        The structural base
                    </p>

                    <p class="hive-triad-card__text">
                        Fermented pollen — near-100% bioavailable.
                        Bees already broke the sporopollenin shell human digestion
                        can't crack. Proteins arrive as usable fragments.
                        Vitamins reach circulation. Enzymes stay active.
                    </p>

                    <p class="hive-triad-card__footer">
                        <strong>Supplies:</strong>
                        energy, immune readiness, gut support
                    </p>

                </div>

            </article>

            <article class="hive-triad-card">

                <picture class="hive-triad-card__picture">
                    <source
                        media="(max-width: 651px)"
                        srcset="{{ 'the-hive-triad-item-2.avif' | file_url | as_avif | append: '&width=390' }}" type="image/avif">
                    <source srcset="{{ 'the-hive-triad-item-2.avif' | file_url | as_avif }}" type="image/avif">
                    <img src="{{ 'the-hive-triad-item-2.webp' | file_url }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="low" alt="Royal Jelly" width="604" height="604">
                </picture>

                <div class="hive-triad-card__body">

                    <span class="hive-triad-card__label">
                        02 — ROYAL JELLY
                    </span>

                    <h3 class="hive-triad-card__dose">
                        500mg
                    </h3>

                    <p class="hive-triad-card__subtitle">
                        The biological signal
                    </p>

                    <p class="hive-triad-card__text">
                        Freeze-dried to protect 10-HDA —
                        the fatty acid found nowhere else in nature.
                        Doesn't fuel cells. Instructs them.
                        Signals recovery, cellular vitality,
                        and regeneration at a working dose.
                    </p>

                    <p class="hive-triad-card__footer">
                        <strong>Signals:</strong>
                        repair, regulation, cognitive clarity
                    </p>

                </div>

            </article>

            <article class="hive-triad-card">

                <picture class="hive-triad-card__picture">
                    <source
                        media="(max-width: 651px)"
                        srcset="{{ 'the-hive-triad-item-3.avif' | file_url | append: '&width=390' }}" type="image/avif">
                    <source srcset="{{ 'the-hive-triad-item-3.avif' |  file_url }}" type="image/avif">
                    <img src="{{ 'the-hive-triad-item-3.webp' |  file_url }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="low" alt="Propolis" width="604" height="604">
                </picture>

                <div class="hive-triad-card__body">

                    <span class="hive-triad-card__label">
                        03 — PROPOLIS
                    </span>

                    <h3 class="hive-triad-card__dose">
                        500mg
                    </h3>

                    <p class="hive-triad-card__subtitle">
                        The environmental shield
                    </p>

                    <p class="hive-triad-card__text">
                        Nature's antimicrobial resin.
                        Reduces inflammatory and oxidative load
                        so biological resources stay allocated toward output —
                        not defense. Clears the path for the other two compounds
                        to work.
                    </p>

                    <p class="hive-triad-card__footer">
                        <strong>Protects:</strong>
                        efficiency, immune order, recovery
                    </p>

                </div>

            </article>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

